# Title: DLL Loaded From Suspicious Location Via Cmspt.EXE
# ID: 75e508f7-932d-4ebc-af77-269237a84ce1
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-08-30
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1218.003
# Description: Detects cmstp loading "dll" or "ocx" files from suspicious locations
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(process_name:*\\cmstp.exe AND (ImageLoaded:*\\PerfLogs\\* OR ImageLoaded:*\\ProgramData\\* OR ImageLoaded:*\\Users\\* OR ImageLoaded:*\\Windows\\Temp\\* OR ImageLoaded:*C:\\Temp\\*) AND (ImageLoaded:*.dll OR ImageLoaded:*.ocx))
